physicalRef: loss_report/database
description: "Logistics cargo theft Link Analysis showcase - One row per loss reported on a shipment: when, and the type - theft (the load did not arrive), shortage (it arrived with goods missing) or non_delivery (the carrier never delivered). One landed file (LOSS_REPORT_20260930.csv); the reports filed in October are in data/staged. Landed by the loss_report Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: reported_at
primaryEntityType: shipment
columns[4]{name,type,classification}:
  loss_id,string,
  shipment_id,string,SHIPMENT
  reported_at,timestamp,
  loss_type,string,
